(2241013, 307019, 47117, '<td valign="top">I''ve been taking star trail shots all week. To get this effect, I had to use at least 20 seconds.  Now if you are in some part of the world where the stars are closer, or brighter, it would work I guess. This also looks like a remake of the 4:00 - 5:00am challenge.  Someone talked about doing that in forum, so this could be an out take for the Deja Vu Challenge, unless its the same photographer but from a different angle.  I will watch for this one after challenge.  Wish there was a bit more originality though in the shot from the 4-5am challenge.</td>', 'I''ve been taking star trail shots all week. To get this effect, I had to use at least 20 seconds.  Now if you are in some part of the world where the stars are closer, or brighter, it would work I guess. This also looks like a remake of the 4:00 - 5:00am challenge.  Someone talked about doing that in forum, so this could be an out take for the Deja Vu Challenge, unless its the same photographer but from a different angle.  I will watch for this one after challenge.  Wish there was a bit more originality though in the shot from the 4-5am challenge.', '2006-03-20 04:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
