(2241713, 308862, 54392, '<td valign="top">The colors seem to be wrong and for some reason the image doesn''t look very sharp. I''ve seen better waterfall photo''s.</td>', 'The colors seem to be wrong and for some reason the image doesn''t look very sharp. I''ve seen better waterfall photo''s.', '2006-03-20 12:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2241715, 308832, 26679, '<td valign="top">Great capture. The colours work well for me. My general observation is that there is nothing about this image to suggest a longish exposure. For me part of meeting the challenge is to produce an image that also looks like the brief, as well as technically taking a 2 sec exposure.<br/> <br/>That all being said this still looks good</td>', 'Great capture. The colours work well for me. My general observation is that there is nothing about this image to suggest a longish exposure. For me part of meeting the challenge is to produce an image that also looks like the brief, as well as technically taking a 2 sec exposure. That all being said this still looks good', '2006-03-20 12:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2241716, 307103, 27482, '<td valign="top">The sky looks pretty awful, way to overexposed and not flattering at all.  Next time I suggest you try and turn your back on the moon when doing nightshots, it´s so much brighter than your surroundings that there is no way to expose it correctly and the foreground other than with a double exposure.</td>', 'The sky looks pretty awful, way to overexposed and not flattering at all.  Next time I suggest you try and turn your back on the moon when doing nightshots, it´s so much brighter than your surroundings that there is no way to expose it correctly and the foreground other than with a double exposure.', '2006-03-20 12:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2241720, 307196, 27482, '<td valign="top">I like Nazguls version much better but this is pretty cool, the surroundings are cool.  Just too much foreground for my taste.  Anyway, one of the better shots in the challenge, got a 7 from me.</td>', 'I like Nazguls version much better but this is pretty cool, the surroundings are cool.  Just too much foreground for my taste.  Anyway, one of the better shots in the challenge, got a 7 from me.', '2006-03-20 12:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
