(2242896, 308522, 37893, '<td valign="top">Red Lipstick + Light Bulb<br/> <br/>I can''t believe this one is scoring a 5! Inconceivable... I mean Incon-theevable (Princess Bride pun).<br/> <br/>The motion here isn''t as apparent. I can see it in the hair and the movement in the right hand as you (?) apply your makeup. The left hand has a bit of shake with I think makes the image suffer. But damn it, you can''t stay still without moving just a tad.<br/> <br/>Anyway, you have been a great sport Cindi and are one of my highly regarded photographers on the site. The use of "white" is really a trademark of yours. The colors make this image pop and the red is a nice touch. I think we''ll be seeing low scores on this challenge. I hope this one goes up higher than median because it does meet the challenge to the mark... as well as my challenge to you.<br/> <br/>For being a great sport Cindi - 10 ;)</td>', 'Red Lipstick + Light Bulb I can''t believe this one is scoring a 5! Inconceivable... I mean Incon-theevable (Princess Bride pun). The motion here isn''t as apparent. I can see it in the hair and the movement in the right hand as you (?) apply your makeup. The left hand has a bit of shake with I think makes the image suffer. But damn it, you can''t stay still without moving just a tad. Anyway, you have been a great sport Cindi and are one of my highly regarded photographers on the site. The use of "white" is really a trademark of yours. The colors make this image pop and the red is a nice touch. I think we''ll be seeing low scores on this challenge. I hope this one goes up higher than median because it does meet the challenge to the mark... as well as my challenge to you. For being a great sport Cindi - 10 ;)', '2006-03-20 22:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2242898, 308725, 75713, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp shot.. well cropped and the blue in it makes it pop more - good choice of background</td>', 'Nice crisp shot.. well cropped and the blue in it makes it pop more - good choice of background', '2006-03-20 22:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2242912, 308418, 75713, '<td valign="top">I like the bright yellow raincoat and your model is sweet.. she doesn''t look petrified (not that I take titles into consideration when voting) I think the composition of this shot could be improved by cropping out a good portion to the left of the girl - I like the way her legs are seen through thte surface in front of her.. might work too if you cropped out the part of that surface - that would create a stronger contrast between her and the others in motion.</td>', 'I like the bright yellow raincoat and your model is sweet.. she doesn''t look petrified (not that I take titles into consideration when voting) I think the composition of this shot could be improved by cropping out a good portion to the left of the girl - I like the way her legs are seen through thte surface in front of her.. might work too if you cropped out the part of that surface - that would create a stronger contrast between her and the others in motion.', '2006-03-20 22:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2242923, 307871, 37893, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. The 8-ball is amazingly tack sharp however it seems a bit flat. This would have been even better had there been a catch light on it. The movement is a great add. This shot would not have been effective otherwise. The crop on the other hand leaves me wanting to see more of the right hand side. I would have probably completed the "pockets" as opposed to just having it cut just on one section. Great shot (pun intended) ;)</td>', 'Nicely done. The 8-ball is amazingly tack sharp however it seems a bit flat. This would have been even better had there been a catch light on it. The movement is a great add. This shot would not have been effective otherwise. The crop on the other hand leaves me wanting to see more of the right hand side. I would have probably completed the "pockets" as opposed to just having it cut just on one section. Great shot (pun intended) ;)', '2006-03-20 22:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2242930, 308555, 75713, '<td valign="top">Nice job with the focus - it''s crisp and the movement of the second hand is well displayed.. I do find this watch to be a bit busy and wonder if cropping it differently might make the second hand more of the focal point.. if of course, that was your intention.. more to the right so the second hand wouldn''t be cut off and less on the bottom might work</td>', 'Nice job with the focus - it''s crisp and the movement of the second hand is well displayed.. I do find this watch to be a bit busy and wonder if cropping it differently might make the second hand more of the focal point.. if of course, that was your intention.. more to the right so the second hand wouldn''t be cut off and less on the bottom might work', '2006-03-20 22:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2242931, 306278, 75713, '<td valign="top">I like the abstract quality of this shot.. the colors are great.. focus is crisp.. very well done</td>', 'I like the abstract quality of this shot.. the colors are great.. focus is crisp.. very well done', '2006-03-20 22:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
