(2243638, 308519, 44611, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this image - and love it.  Perhaps it should be sharper, I''m not sure whether that would improve it or not, but the colours are fabulous, the composition interesting and the light is really unusual.  Good luck.</td>', 'I keep coming back to this image - and love it.  Perhaps it should be sharper, I''m not sure whether that would improve it or not, but the colours are fabulous, the composition interesting and the light is really unusual.  Good luck.', '2006-03-21 06:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2243642, 307199, 44611, '<td valign="top">Dead and dying flowers are very difficult to photograph attractively.  I think you''ve got the lighting right here, but the image is let down by a rather distracting, but uninteresting background plus too many flowers which makes the picture too busy.  The muted colours are good.</td>', 'Dead and dying flowers are very difficult to photograph attractively.  I think you''ve got the lighting right here, but the image is let down by a rather distracting, but uninteresting background plus too many flowers which makes the picture too busy.  The muted colours are good.', '2006-03-21 06:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2243645, 308703, 44611, '<td valign="top">Not a bad picture of a rose, but not exceptional either.  Composition is very central - would be much better off centre.  The out of focus background a bit distracting, it might work in colour, but not so in b &amp; w.</td>', 'Not a bad picture of a rose, but not exceptional either.  Composition is very central - would be much better off centre.  The out of focus background a bit distracting, it might work in colour, but not so in b & w.', '2006-03-21 06:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2243646, 307977, 44611, '<td valign="top">The light seems quite harsh in this shot and it is a shame that the overall scene has little of interest.  You''ve shot the water well, but somehow it isn''t quite enough to make this scene create a ''wow''.  Perhaps having something in the foreground, or someone on the ''bridge'' above the water (is that a bridge - I''m not sure).</td>', 'The light seems quite harsh in this shot and it is a shame that the overall scene has little of interest.  You''ve shot the water well, but somehow it isn''t quite enough to make this scene create a ''wow''.  Perhaps having something in the foreground, or someone on the ''bridge'' above the water (is that a bridge - I''m not sure).', '2006-03-21 06:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
