(2243653, 308025, 44611, '<td valign="top">I''ll bet your lava lamp shows a much broader range of colours than we see here. <br/> <br/>My idea for this challenge was not dissimiliar to this, but with a coloured light ball rather than a lava lamp.  In the end I ditched all my shots and did not enter, much for the same reason that I don''t think this will score high.  Forgive me if I''m wrong, I''m only trying to help.<br/> <br/>My ball glowed pink, red, orange and green, and yet when I shot it on 2 secs I could only ever get two of those colours showing, plus a large chunk of white.  I''m not sure what the answer is, but perhaps some kind person with more experience would give advice for avoiding the problem another time.</td>', 'I''ll bet your lava lamp shows a much broader range of colours than we see here.  My idea for this challenge was not dissimiliar to this, but with a coloured light ball rather than a lava lamp.  In the end I ditched all my shots and did not enter, much for the same reason that I don''t think this will score high.  Forgive me if I''m wrong, I''m only trying to help. My ball glowed pink, red, orange and green, and yet when I shot it on 2 secs I could only ever get two of those colours showing, plus a large chunk of white.  I''m not sure what the answer is, but perhaps some kind person with more experience would give advice for avoiding the problem another time.', '2006-03-21 06:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
