(2244228, 308636, 15919, '<td valign="top">Seems to be pretty popular subject in this challenge.  Technically well done but maybe not very original.</td>', 'Seems to be pretty popular subject in this challenge.  Technically well done but maybe not very original.', '2006-03-21 12:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244229, 307080, 50745, '<td valign="top">really interesting shot, like it a lot.</td>', 'really interesting shot, like it a lot.', '2006-03-21 12:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244230, 308554, 27482, '<td valign="top">That house, or that specific building style really reminds me of my old school in Stockholm, Sweden, it´s name is "Johannes Skola".  Wierd, I am going to look this shot up after the challenge and see where this house is, hope you include it in the "photographers comments" :)</td>', 'That house, or that specific building style really reminds me of my old school in Stockholm, Sweden, it´s name is "Johannes Skola".  Wierd, I am going to look this shot up after the challenge and see where this house is, hope you include it in the "photographers comments" :)', '2006-03-21 12:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244234, 307582, 15919, '<td valign="top">like the processing</td>', 'like the processing', '2006-03-21 12:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244235, 308315, 15919, '<td valign="top">Technically well done and visually pretty good</td>', 'Technically well done and visually pretty good', '2006-03-21 12:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244238, 308709, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but not fond of the effect the shutterspeed had on this photo, it just gives me vertigo if anything and I don´t think it´s even close to being aesthetically pleasing, that´s why I only gave it a 4 even though I think it meets the challenge head on.  Not trying to offend, just figured you deserved an explanation for the relatively low score.</td>', 'Sorry but not fond of the effect the shutterspeed had on this photo, it just gives me vertigo if anything and I don´t think it´s even close to being aesthetically pleasing, that´s why I only gave it a 4 even though I think it meets the challenge head on.  Not trying to offend, just figured you deserved an explanation for the relatively low score.', '2006-03-21 12:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244239, 308877, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice, but the sunset isn´t really anything to say hooray about, I guess it´s the best you can hope for when you only have one week and can´t count on the weather :)  Like the composition.</td>', 'Nice, but the sunset isn´t really anything to say hooray about, I guess it´s the best you can hope for when you only have one week and can´t count on the weather :)  Like the composition.', '2006-03-21 12:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244241, 308418, 15919, '<td valign="top">Good idea and technically well done.  But I do think you could have chosen more interesting location</td>', 'Good idea and technically well done.  But I do think you could have chosen more interesting location', '2006-03-21 12:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244245, 308357, 15919, '<td valign="top">Quite original and interesting.  Not sure though the the outcome excites me much</td>', 'Quite original and interesting.  Not sure though the the outcome excites me much', '2006-03-21 12:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244249, 306592, 54392, '<td valign="top">the background is too bright, and the image not dark enough to be a silhouette.</td>', 'the background is too bright, and the image not dark enough to be a silhouette.', '2006-03-21 12:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244251, 308180, 15919, '<td valign="top">Nice experiment and good idea though visually it doesnt interest me very much</td>', 'Nice experiment and good idea though visually it doesnt interest me very much', '2006-03-21 12:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244254, 307726, 15919, '<td valign="top">Nice processing and visually intersting place</td>', 'Nice processing and visually intersting place', '2006-03-21 12:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244262, 308709, 15919, '<td valign="top">Not sure i like the whole over motion blurr</td>', 'Not sure i like the whole over motion blurr', '2006-03-21 12:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244265, 308678, 15919, '<td valign="top">Good idea and pretty well done</td>', 'Good idea and pretty well done', '2006-03-21 12:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244284, 308749, 47487, '<td valign="top">holy cow, that''s fantastic.</td>', 'holy cow, that''s fantastic.', '2006-03-21 12:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244285, 307196, 47487, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Those aren''t those fire-ball things, are they. Looks dangerous. :)</td>', 'Very cool. Those aren''t those fire-ball things, are they. Looks dangerous. :)', '2006-03-21 12:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244293, 308644, 54392, '<td valign="top">...and out of focus...</td>', '...and out of focus...', '2006-03-21 12:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244321, 307856, 51802, '<td valign="top">I would be very interested to see how you did this with a two second exposure.  How did you get the bulb to be fozen in time while still showing the motion of the hammer???<br/> <br/>Thanks for the PM explaining how you did this!!!  You got me thinking about a whole new way to shoot! (bumping up)</td>', 'I would be very interested to see how you did this with a two second exposure.  How did you get the bulb to be fozen in time while still showing the motion of the hammer??? Thanks for the PM explaining how you did this!!!  You got me thinking about a whole new way to shoot! (bumping up)', '2006-03-21 13:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
