(2244385, 308206, 35334, '<td valign="top">Nice. I might have shown a little more of the left arch--to show the opening through which the boats are being guided. I would also have made the bridge pillar vertical; it looks slanted to the left. But this is nitpicking; I really liked the tonality and feel of the image.</td>', 'Nice. I might have shown a little more of the left arch--to show the opening through which the boats are being guided. I would also have made the bridge pillar vertical; it looks slanted to the left. But this is nitpicking; I really liked the tonality and feel of the image.', '2006-03-21 13:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244387, 307944, 35334, '<td valign="top">This is a nice image but it looks to me that it was created in Photoshop rather than by a real (2-second) motion blur.</td>', 'This is a nice image but it looks to me that it was created in Photoshop rather than by a real (2-second) motion blur.', '2006-03-21 13:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244390, 308752, 35334, '<td valign="top">I wish my cat would hold still while I took her picture. Whenever I point the camera in her direction, she quietly moves away. This is a nice cat picture, but it doesn''t look like a 2-second exposure (even if it actually is one).</td>', 'I wish my cat would hold still while I took her picture. Whenever I point the camera in her direction, she quietly moves away. This is a nice cat picture, but it doesn''t look like a 2-second exposure (even if it actually is one).', '2006-03-21 13:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244392, 308644, 35334, '<td valign="top">Reasonably good night shot but nothing particularly distinguished about it.</td>', 'Reasonably good night shot but nothing particularly distinguished about it.', '2006-03-21 13:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244394, 308554, 35334, '<td valign="top">Eerie! Nice night shot.</td>', 'Eerie! Nice night shot.', '2006-03-21 13:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244396, 307148, 35334, '<td valign="top">This is certainly one of the better candle shots.</td>', 'This is certainly one of the better candle shots.', '2006-03-21 13:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244399, 308360, 35334, '<td valign="top">Nice, but nothing to raise it to the next level, either as a photographic image or as an expression of a 2-second exposure.</td>', 'Nice, but nothing to raise it to the next level, either as a photographic image or as an expression of a 2-second exposure.', '2006-03-21 13:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244402, 307437, 35334, '<td valign="top">Technically very good (and will get a good score from me) but I don''t connect with it emotionally.</td>', 'Technically very good (and will get a good score from me) but I don''t connect with it emotionally.', '2006-03-21 13:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244405, 308848, 35334, '<td valign="top">Fire or ice? Looks cold to me.</td>', 'Fire or ice? Looks cold to me.', '2006-03-21 13:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244408, 308232, 35334, '<td valign="top">It''s OK but I don''t see anything that would raise this above any other twilight shot.</td>', 'It''s OK but I don''t see anything that would raise this above any other twilight shot.', '2006-03-21 13:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244410, 308790, 35334, '<td valign="top">Nice motion blur in the water.</td>', 'Nice motion blur in the water.', '2006-03-21 13:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244415, 308795, 35334, '<td valign="top">Real volcanoes don''t look like this, so what is it? Nice color, static composition.</td>', 'Real volcanoes don''t look like this, so what is it? Nice color, static composition.', '2006-03-21 13:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244416, 308245, 46468, '<td valign="top">love the contrast of the "motion" of the water against the stationary rock, ice and snow. The water really feels liquid, esp. right before it goes over the falls. I also like that you are on the same level as the lake surface. Only thing that I personally find a wee bit distracting is the water dead center at the bottom, it seems to start from nowhere and my eyes keep returning to it to find the source. I love waterfall pics and this on is nicely done. Good Luck</td>', 'love the contrast of the "motion" of the water against the stationary rock, ice and snow. The water really feels liquid, esp. right before it goes over the falls. I also like that you are on the same level as the lake surface. Only thing that I personally find a wee bit distracting is the water dead center at the bottom, it seems to start from nowhere and my eyes keep returning to it to find the source. I love waterfall pics and this on is nicely done. Good Luck', '2006-03-21 13:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244418, 306689, 42100, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and well exposed.  Very nice!</td>', 'Nicely composed and well exposed.  Very nice!', '2006-03-21 13:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244419, 307256, 35334, '<td valign="top">Yet another clock face with second hand. This is OK but I''m getting tired of them.</td>', 'Yet another clock face with second hand. This is OK but I''m getting tired of them.', '2006-03-21 13:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244421, 307079, 46468, '<td valign="top">The white against the green is a striking contrast, nicely done and good luck</td>', 'The white against the green is a striking contrast, nicely done and good luck', '2006-03-21 13:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244422, 307019, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very pretty and calming photograph.  The stars really make the composition.  Very nice!</td>', 'Very pretty and calming photograph.  The stars really make the composition.  Very nice!', '2006-03-21 14:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244424, 308852, 35334, '<td valign="top">Nice. I like the texture of the shadows on the wall; I wish the front weren''t so bright.</td>', 'Nice. I like the texture of the shadows on the wall; I wish the front weren''t so bright.', '2006-03-21 14:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244426, 308188, 42100, '<td valign="top">Well composed and super cool motion photograph.  Very nice!</td>', 'Well composed and super cool motion photograph.  Very nice!', '2006-03-21 14:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244427, 308380, 35334, '<td valign="top">This is with an IR filter? It is a good idea and I really like the plants in the foreground. But overall it doesn''t quite work for me and I''m not sure why.</td>', 'This is with an IR filter? It is a good idea and I really like the plants in the foreground. But overall it doesn''t quite work for me and I''m not sure why.', '2006-03-21 14:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244428, 308056, 46468, '<td valign="top">Beautiful waterfall, however the whites seems to be slightly overexposed in some areas therefore losing details to those areas. Otherwise love the angle and the composition, the way the falls start in the upper left thirds and leads the eyes throughout the pic, Good luck</td>', 'Beautiful waterfall, however the whites seems to be slightly overexposed in some areas therefore losing details to those areas. Otherwise love the angle and the composition, the way the falls start in the upper left thirds and leads the eyes throughout the pic, Good luck', '2006-03-21 14:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244429, 307726, 42100, '<td valign="top">Has the strong look of a PS filter, but I like the grittyness and detail.  Compostion is stellar.  Very nice!</td>', 'Has the strong look of a PS filter, but I like the grittyness and detail.  Compostion is stellar.  Very nice!', '2006-03-21 14:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244430, 308539, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very nice compostion and great tones.  I really like the movement the blurred person gives to the photo.  Super cool!</td>', 'Very nice compostion and great tones.  I really like the movement the blurred person gives to the photo.  Super cool!', '2006-03-21 14:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244432, 308532, 46468, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scenery, think I would have preferred it with the people cropped out as they are a distraction to me. Otherwise nicely done</td>', 'Beautiful scenery, think I would have preferred it with the people cropped out as they are a distraction to me. Otherwise nicely done', '2006-03-21 14:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244433, 307471, 42100, '<td valign="top">Nice originality and creativity to the ''rose photo.''  The color is great and soft detail is way cool.  Well done!</td>', 'Nice originality and creativity to the ''rose photo.''  The color is great and soft detail is way cool.  Well done!', '2006-03-21 14:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244434, 308089, 35334, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea but it doesn''t quite work for me. His head has been lost. That might be part of your point, but to me, he doesn''t seem to be a person without a head.</td>', 'This is a good idea but it doesn''t quite work for me. His head has been lost. That might be part of your point, but to me, he doesn''t seem to be a person without a head.', '2006-03-21 14:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244436, 308314, 35334, '<td valign="top">nice sunset but otherwise undistinguished</td>', 'nice sunset but otherwise undistinguished', '2006-03-21 14:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244438, 308370, 35334, '<td valign="top">Kewl!</td>', 'Kewl!', '2006-03-21 14:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244439, 307005, 46468, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, like the framing of the moon, however the whites seem to be a little blown. Otherwise nicely done</td>', 'Nice idea, like the framing of the moon, however the whites seem to be a little blown. Otherwise nicely done', '2006-03-21 14:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244441, 307196, 42100, '<td valign="top">Your choice of setting is perfect for your ring of fire photo. Very nicely done!</td>', 'Your choice of setting is perfect for your ring of fire photo. Very nicely done!', '2006-03-21 14:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244443, 308275, 42100, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and composition.  Perhaps a little on the boring side color wise.</td>', 'Nice detail and composition.  Perhaps a little on the boring side color wise.', '2006-03-21 14:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244444, 308216, 35334, '<td valign="top">Yet another second hand. This one doesn''t even show the motion of the second hand. How can it be a 2-second exposure?</td>', 'Yet another second hand. This one doesn''t even show the motion of the second hand. How can it be a 2-second exposure?', '2006-03-21 14:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244445, 307000, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very nice framing composition.  Like the rich color tones.  Well done!</td>', 'Very nice framing composition.  Like the rich color tones.  Well done!', '2006-03-21 14:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244448, 308616, 35334, '<td valign="top">I really like this. The lines and shapes in the foreground work well with the forms of the bridge.</td>', 'I really like this. The lines and shapes in the foreground work well with the forms of the bridge.', '2006-03-21 14:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244450, 308639, 35334, '<td valign="top">very good vibes!</td>', 'very good vibes!', '2006-03-21 14:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244451, 307267, 35876, '<td valign="top">Very nice pic! I like very much the colors!</td>', 'Very nice pic! I like very much the colors!', '2006-03-21 14:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244452, 308680, 42100, '<td valign="top">I like those slow cooked details and tones in the cliff face and the silky smooth falls.  The rainbow really finishes.  Very cool!</td>', 'I like those slow cooked details and tones in the cliff face and the silky smooth falls.  The rainbow really finishes.  Very cool!', '2006-03-21 14:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244453, 307975, 35334, '<td valign="top">Better than most of the clock shots but still not great.</td>', 'Better than most of the clock shots but still not great.', '2006-03-21 14:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244455, 307871, 35876, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!!!!! :)</td>', 'Nice shot!!!!! :)', '2006-03-21 14:13:55.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2244458, 308519, 42100, '<td valign="top">Busy would describe this well, lacks a focal point, still a very good photo.  The color and tones are very nice.</td>', 'Busy would describe this well, lacks a focal point, still a very good photo.  The color and tones are very nice.', '2006-03-21 14:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244460, 307267, 46468, '<td valign="top">Love the reds in the sky and the reflections. The silhouette  of the two birds adds a lot to the picture. I really love how the large one is looking towards the small one and visa versa. They seem to be intent on each other and oblivious to the beautiful surrounding and the photographer. Only distraction I see is the slightly blown area in the top mid left area. Otherwise well composed and beautifully done. Good luck</td>', 'Love the reds in the sky and the reflections. The silhouette  of the two birds adds a lot to the picture. I really love how the large one is looking towards the small one and visa versa. They seem to be intent on each other and oblivious to the beautiful surrounding and the photographer. Only distraction I see is the slightly blown area in the top mid left area. Otherwise well composed and beautifully done. Good luck', '2006-03-21 14:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244462, 308338, 35334, '<td valign="top">Technically good but I don''t get any emotional feeling. Maybe it would have helped if she were looking at the lollipop.</td>', 'Technically good but I don''t get any emotional feeling. Maybe it would have helped if she were looking at the lollipop.', '2006-03-21 14:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244464, 308522, 42100, '<td valign="top">A very nice photo, but seems almost a little to busy compositionally.</td>', 'A very nice photo, but seems almost a little to busy compositionally.', '2006-03-21 14:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244468, 308858, 42100, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed photograph.  I like the nearly desaturated look for this photo.  Great job!</td>', 'Nicely composed photograph.  I like the nearly desaturated look for this photo.  Great job!', '2006-03-21 14:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244472, 308650, 35334, '<td valign="top">I tried once to photograph falling dominoes and did not succeed. Although your effort is better than mine, I don''t think you have done anything that would raise it to the next level.</td>', 'I tried once to photograph falling dominoes and did not succeed. Although your effort is better than mine, I don''t think you have done anything that would raise it to the next level.', '2006-03-21 14:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244475, 308324, 35334, '<td valign="top">nice view</td>', 'nice view', '2006-03-21 14:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244479, 307871, 46468, '<td valign="top">Good focus on the eight ball and surrounding, nice motion on the cue ball. I bet this took a few tries to get the timing down for this. Good luck</td>', 'Good focus on the eight ball and surrounding, nice motion on the cue ball. I bet this took a few tries to get the timing down for this. Good luck', '2006-03-21 14:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244483, 308119, 26464, '<td valign="top">interesting... would have been ever better to see frame of screen to illustrate ''dipping in'' more. but a 6.</td>', 'interesting... would have been ever better to see frame of screen to illustrate ''dipping in'' more. but a 6.', '2006-03-21 14:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244485, 308836, 31443, '<td valign="top">I like this image very much, the duotone and shadows are just right..</td>', 'I like this image very much, the duotone and shadows are just right..', '2006-03-21 14:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244490, 307009, 42100, '<td valign="top">The snow on the pines saves it from being a full on sillouhette, I like that.  The clouds over the moons is very cool looking effect and makes the photo more interesting.  Very nice!</td>', 'The snow on the pines saves it from being a full on sillouhette, I like that.  The clouds over the moons is very cool looking effect and makes the photo more interesting.  Very nice!', '2006-03-21 14:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244491, 308320, 35334, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what this is. (One of my guesses would not be allowed on DPC.) I like the colors, but it looks more out of focus to me than blurred by a 2-second exposure.</td>', 'I''m not sure what this is. (One of my guesses would not be allowed on DPC.) I like the colors, but it looks more out of focus to me than blurred by a 2-second exposure.', '2006-03-21 14:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
