(2244505, 307316, 46468, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, love the greens and orangish colors to the rocks. The motion to the falls is nicely captured. I would have liked to see just a wee bit more towards the top, my eyes seem to be drawn back there to find the rest of the picture, instead of focusing on the falls as they should. Or maybe even a tighter crop towards the top so that I don''t get the feeling that I am missing something. Just my opinion. Nicely done and good luck</td>', 'Nicely done, love the greens and orangish colors to the rocks. The motion to the falls is nicely captured. I would have liked to see just a wee bit more towards the top, my eyes seem to be drawn back there to find the rest of the picture, instead of focusing on the falls as they should. Or maybe even a tighter crop towards the top so that I don''t get the feeling that I am missing something. Just my opinion. Nicely done and good luck', '2006-03-21 14:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2244506, 308115, 35334, '<td valign="top">OK. I don''t care for the sharp sign on the left. It takes up too much of the image space and doesn''t do much more than identify the setting. With your title, you don''t need it. I think it would be better to eliminate the sign and focus your camera on the menu on the counter.</td>', 'OK. I don''t care for the sharp sign on the left. It takes up too much of the image space and doesn''t do much more than identify the setting. With your title, you don''t need it. I think it would be better to eliminate the sign and focus your camera on the menu on the counter.', '2006-03-21 14:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
