(2245224, 308886, 41522, '<td valign="top">For an image like this, I would like a little more dynamic composition, instead of the decoration being situated in the middle of the photo.  Also, the chain isn''t really vertical but the decoration is not really swinging, so the chain looks strange to me hanging off to the side a little.  Finally, the grain on the photo makes it look like the object is out of focus.</td>', 'For an image like this, I would like a little more dynamic composition, instead of the decoration being situated in the middle of the photo.  Also, the chain isn''t really vertical but the decoration is not really swinging, so the chain looks strange to me hanging off to the side a little.  Finally, the grain on the photo makes it look like the object is out of focus.', '2006-03-21 19:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2245229, 308221, 41522, '<td valign="top">What I was looking for in this challenge was something that dramatically used the 2 second exposure instead of a still life.  Also, the focus looks a little soft to me.</td>', 'What I was looking for in this challenge was something that dramatically used the 2 second exposure instead of a still life.  Also, the focus looks a little soft to me.', '2006-03-21 19:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
