(2245237, 307726, 41522, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic photo, with great tones and very nice composition.  What I''ve been looking fo in this challenge is dramatic use of the 2 second exposure.  I think that you could have achieved this great result with almost any reasonable shutter speed.  The 2 second exposure hasn''t added any dramatic effect for me in this otherwise amazing shot.</td>', 'This is a fantastic photo, with great tones and very nice composition.  What I''ve been looking fo in this challenge is dramatic use of the 2 second exposure.  I think that you could have achieved this great result with almost any reasonable shutter speed.  The 2 second exposure hasn''t added any dramatic effect for me in this otherwise amazing shot.', '2006-03-21 19:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2245240, 307103, 41522, '<td valign="top">The soft focus and overexposed sky are a problem for me in this image.  Perhaps a graduated ND filter might have helped the overexposed sky.</td>', 'The soft focus and overexposed sky are a problem for me in this image.  Perhaps a graduated ND filter might have helped the overexposed sky.', '2006-03-21 19:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
