(2249291, 308245, 18374, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.  I like the framing and the detail in this shot.  Nice exposure on the snow too.  This is one of my top picks for this challenge.  My only negative criticism is that the framing at the top of the shot feels a little awkward, but I can''t quite figure out why.  Maybe the crop is too tight?  Or maybe it is the perspective of being at eye level with the lake.  Anyway, good luck!</td>', 'Very nice photo.  I like the framing and the detail in this shot.  Nice exposure on the snow too.  This is one of my top picks for this challenge.  My only negative criticism is that the framing at the top of the shot feels a little awkward, but I can''t quite figure out why.  Maybe the crop is too tight?  Or maybe it is the perspective of being at eye level with the lake.  Anyway, good luck!', '2006-03-22 21:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
