(2249699, 307506, 54747, '<td valign="top">Oddly enough, the background is phenomenal in it''s aspect, the light and shadow are just right, but then the flags distract from that with the blur.</td>', 'Oddly enough, the background is phenomenal in it''s aspect, the light and shadow are just right, but then the flags distract from that with the blur.', '2006-03-22 23:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2249701, 308188, 54747, '<td valign="top">Looks just like a professional commercial shot.  Very nice.</td>', 'Looks just like a professional commercial shot.  Very nice.', '2006-03-22 23:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2249706, 308672, 54747, '<td valign="top">I really want to know if this was done the way I think it was.  How ever you did it, great effect, very creepy.</td>', 'I really want to know if this was done the way I think it was.  How ever you did it, great effect, very creepy.', '2006-03-22 23:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2249711, 307726, 54747, '<td valign="top">This is simply stunning.  It looks like a deeply detailed painting, not a photograph.  Gorgeous work.</td>', 'This is simply stunning.  It looks like a deeply detailed painting, not a photograph.  Gorgeous work.', '2006-03-22 23:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2249714, 307196, 54747, '<td valign="top">My only critique of this is that, if the person were static, it would draw the eye toward him/her, at the center of all that motion.  Still, great juxtaposition and color between the main subject and the background.</td>', 'My only critique of this is that, if the person were static, it would draw the eye toward him/her, at the center of all that motion.  Still, great juxtaposition and color between the main subject and the background.', '2006-03-22 23:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2249724, 308509, 54747, '<td valign="top">Way too busy for the eye to land on any one aspect.  The lines are too jumbled for me to enjoy it as an abstract piece, there don''t seem to be any unifying factors.  Perhaps if the lines were moving in similar directions to frame each other and the negative space between them, or if there were a bit more hint of something behind the abstract to draw the user into the image to think and discover more.</td>', 'Way too busy for the eye to land on any one aspect.  The lines are too jumbled for me to enjoy it as an abstract piece, there don''t seem to be any unifying factors.  Perhaps if the lines were moving in similar directions to frame each other and the negative space between them, or if there were a bit more hint of something behind the abstract to draw the user into the image to think and discover more.', '2006-03-22 23:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2249728, 308709, 54747, '<td valign="top">This shot really needs a tripod to steady the static areas of the image to bring out the areas of motion that a 2" shutter provides.  If the overall motion was the goal, admirably done, but it simply looks like a blurry shot, nothing distinguishing.  Make a single aspect static, to draw the eye (like the sidewalk or tree) and it would make more sense, I think.</td>', 'This shot really needs a tripod to steady the static areas of the image to bring out the areas of motion that a 2" shutter provides.  If the overall motion was the goal, admirably done, but it simply looks like a blurry shot, nothing distinguishing.  Make a single aspect static, to draw the eye (like the sidewalk or tree) and it would make more sense, I think.', '2006-03-22 23:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2249730, 306188, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice contrast you have created</td>', 'nice contrast you have created', '2006-03-22 23:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2249733, 308357, 54747, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the flooding of light, but it has washed out the detail on the boat.  Perhaps if you changed the stops to let in a bit less, it would have kept the detail and still acheived the flooded isolation you appear to be going for.</td>', 'I enjoy the flooding of light, but it has washed out the detail on the boat.  Perhaps if you changed the stops to let in a bit less, it would have kept the detail and still acheived the flooded isolation you appear to be going for.', '2006-03-22 23:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2249738, 308886, 54747, '<td valign="top">Nothing in this shot really draws me in.  The light off the bird seems to wash out it''s color, while the reflections of the flash or light source on the chain emphasis it over pretty much everything else.  The black and white stripes distract from the clean lines of the background.</td>', 'Nothing in this shot really draws me in.  The light off the bird seems to wash out it''s color, while the reflections of the flash or light source on the chain emphasis it over pretty much everything else.  The black and white stripes distract from the clean lines of the background.', '2006-03-22 23:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2249742, 308318, 54747, '<td valign="top">The stasis of everything else is wonderful in relation to the rapid motion of the subject, but I feel the motion is too fast, too blurry.  Perhaps a bit slower would have given a modicum of descriptive of the person moving, and would draw the eye more?</td>', 'The stasis of everything else is wonderful in relation to the rapid motion of the subject, but I feel the motion is too fast, too blurry.  Perhaps a bit slower would have given a modicum of descriptive of the person moving, and would draw the eye more?', '2006-03-22 23:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2249755, 306765, 13688, '<td valign="top">i like your beveled frame.  cool idea for the burning rubber.  it''s funny that you had to "dodge" to create the "burn"....at least it was funny to me.</td>', 'i like your beveled frame.  cool idea for the burning rubber.  it''s funny that you had to "dodge" to create the "burn"....at least it was funny to me.', '2006-03-22 23:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2249761, 308738, 13688, '<td valign="top">not to say this isn''t cool now but i think in 50 years it will be super cool.  Like today looking back at the facades of the old theaters.  nice symmetry</td>', 'not to say this isn''t cool now but i think in 50 years it will be super cool.  Like today looking back at the facades of the old theaters.  nice symmetry', '2006-03-22 23:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2249793, 308279, 13688, '<td valign="top">i''m not 100% sure what is going on but I''ve got to give you a 10 for getting the street lamp to come out as it did...and the women''s ghostly face framing.  the entire composition and lighting are fantastic and quite a trip.</td>', 'i''m not 100% sure what is going on but I''ve got to give you a 10 for getting the street lamp to come out as it did...and the women''s ghostly face framing.  the entire composition and lighting are fantastic and quite a trip.', '2006-03-22 23:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2249801, 308314, 13688, '<td valign="top">great colors.  i''m struggling with the border...though i know it needs one, this one does seem to draw a bit too much attention.</td>', 'great colors.  i''m struggling with the border...though i know it needs one, this one does seem to draw a bit too much attention.', '2006-03-22 23:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2249806, 307988, 13688, '<td valign="top">i like the space you''ve left at the top to give the eye some time to rest</td>', 'i like the space you''ve left at the top to give the eye some time to rest', '2006-03-23 00:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2249813, 308245, 38131, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, great shot!</td>', 'Beautiful, great shot!', '2006-03-23 00:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2249830, 308709, 13688, '<td valign="top">very interesting.  the couple''s position makes you feel as if something tragic is about to occur and i think really compliments the shake.  i''m not sure about the jogger, but if he was a mysterious figure coming at them, i might be a little freaked out right now.  cool idea.</td>', 'very interesting.  the couple''s position makes you feel as if something tragic is about to occur and i think really compliments the shake.  i''m not sure about the jogger, but if he was a mysterious figure coming at them, i might be a little freaked out right now.  cool idea.', '2006-03-23 00:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2249845, 308823, 13688, '<td valign="top">i''m feeling it.  I wish you got some without the mic stand.  a big floating head on a black background with the light trails and that expression would make for some good black light poster material</td>', 'i''m feeling it.  I wish you got some without the mic stand.  a big floating head on a black background with the light trails and that expression would make for some good black light poster material', '2006-03-23 00:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2249848, 308526, 38131, '<td valign="top">This is a fun pic</td>', 'This is a fun pic', '2006-03-23 00:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2249850, 307256, 13688, '<td valign="top">unique angle. great point of focus.  i wish you edited out the logo.</td>', 'unique angle. great point of focus.  i wish you edited out the logo.', '2006-03-23 00:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2249853, 307726, 38131, '<td valign="top">Love the coloring on this</td>', 'Love the coloring on this', '2006-03-23 00:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2249864, 306259, 38131, '<td valign="top">Oh god that looks funny....a loud whirring noise comes to mind.</td>', 'Oh god that looks funny....a loud whirring noise comes to mind.', '2006-03-23 00:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2249869, 307793, 13688, '<td valign="top">i think a thin beige border would have really strengthen your score, but it wouldn''t help convey a reflective feeling perhaps you were also trying to achieve.  I see two black spots along the shell edge.  I only point them out because it shows that the bg should have had a small level adjustment as they seem to be true black.</td>', 'i think a thin beige border would have really strengthen your score, but it wouldn''t help convey a reflective feeling perhaps you were also trying to achieve.  I see two black spots along the shell edge.  I only point them out because it shows that the bg should have had a small level adjustment as they seem to be true black.', '2006-03-23 00:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2249878, 308858, 38131, '<td valign="top">This wouldve been better if youd have taken the pic DURING the shot...</td>', 'This wouldve been better if youd have taken the pic DURING the shot...', '2006-03-23 00:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2249902, 307734, 13688, '<td valign="top">interesting.  like the gradiant background.  It''s like 2 gold dolphins diving to the depths of tropical waters.  I must be ready for winter to end.</td>', 'interesting.  like the gradiant background.  It''s like 2 gold dolphins diving to the depths of tropical waters.  I must be ready for winter to end.', '2006-03-23 00:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2249916, 308766, 13688, '<td valign="top">like the duotone idea.  For me, everything feels too close to the borders.  i think if you gave your composition some room to breath it would be quite pleasing.  perhaps you had a limited background to work with</td>', 'like the duotone idea.  For me, everything feels too close to the borders.  i think if you gave your composition some room to breath it would be quite pleasing.  perhaps you had a limited background to work with', '2006-03-23 00:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2249923, 308871, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice focus and lighting.  i know it''s your art, but i really like this rotated clockwise 45 degrees.  i feel like i can fall into the hole easier</td>', 'nice focus and lighting.  i know it''s your art, but i really like this rotated clockwise 45 degrees.  i feel like i can fall into the hole easier', '2006-03-23 00:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2249939, 307606, 13688, '<td valign="top">well executed zoom, with the clever title.  Perhaps i''ve been hanging around this site too much, but i wish the background was true black.  i see you would have had to mask it as changing the overall level would have effected the tips too much</td>', 'well executed zoom, with the clever title.  Perhaps i''ve been hanging around this site too much, but i wish the background was true black.  i see you would have had to mask it as changing the overall level would have effected the tips too much', '2006-03-23 00:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2249946, 308712, 13688, '<td valign="top">great idea and angle to help add to the feeling.  well executed.</td>', 'great idea and angle to help add to the feeling.  well executed.', '2006-03-23 00:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2250087, 307198, 48717, '<td valign="top">Great color.</td>', 'Great color.', '2006-03-23 01:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2250088, 308751, 23913, '<td valign="top">a little noisy but over nice shot, its nice to have the light on the water. gives it a difinition and makes it more than a void.</td>', 'a little noisy but over nice shot, its nice to have the light on the water. gives it a difinition and makes it more than a void.', '2006-03-23 01:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2250101, 308823, 23913, '<td valign="top">over all its a nice capture however hving the mic stand out of focus in the F.ground is a major distraction and doesn''t act as a leading line (which is what i think it is ment to be. i feel the image as a whole would be alot stronger if it were eliminiated from the framing.</td>', 'over all its a nice capture however hving the mic stand out of focus in the F.ground is a major distraction and doesn''t act as a leading line (which is what i think it is ment to be. i feel the image as a whole would be alot stronger if it were eliminiated from the framing.', '2006-03-23 01:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2250104, 308275, 23913, '<td valign="top">nice lighting and sharp focus</td>', 'nice lighting and sharp focus', '2006-03-23 01:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2250123, 307871, 23913, '<td valign="top">this image IMO is hurt by harch dark shadows, to much contrast and poor choice of DoF use.<br/> <br/>the very pocket should be infocus as well as the 8 ball maybe f16.....the light should be from both sides to minimize shadow or at least a fill from the left to cut down on the intencity. and curves should be used as well as maybe a screen layer to lighten the image and make the color brighter and more natural, not contrast which drove away defination of shape in the 8 ball.<br/> <br/>GL well worth a reshoot/edit</td>', 'this image IMO is hurt by harch dark shadows, to much contrast and poor choice of DoF use. the very pocket should be infocus as well as the 8 ball maybe f16.....the light should be from both sides to minimize shadow or at least a fill from the left to cut down on the intencity. and curves should be used as well as maybe a screen layer to lighten the image and make the color brighter and more natural, not contrast which drove away defination of shape in the 8 ball. GL well worth a reshoot/edit', '2006-03-23 02:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2250128, 308639, 23913, '<td valign="top">my friend has this same bass in the same color, it is sitting in my room right as i type this and i use it to back myself on recordings, but that is irrelivent, it is late here.....<br/> <br/>the shot is good nice use of DoF i would''ve messed with the WB and set it for tungston lighting. but never the less good idea great sence of motiong in the strings a slight USM may have also helped to really make everything but the strings sharp. at least for the web(smaller version) GL</td>', 'my friend has this same bass in the same color, it is sitting in my room right as i type this and i use it to back myself on recordings, but that is irrelivent, it is late here..... the shot is good nice use of DoF i would''ve messed with the WB and set it for tungston lighting. but never the less good idea great sence of motiong in the strings a slight USM may have also helped to really make everything but the strings sharp. at least for the web(smaller version) GL', '2006-03-23 02:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2250131, 306322, 23913, '<td valign="top">nice post prossess it looks painted (in spots) the whites a splended, as is the over all composition. reaally beautiful image GL</td>', 'nice post prossess it looks painted (in spots) the whites a splended, as is the over all composition. reaally beautiful image GL', '2006-03-23 02:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2250135, 308216, 23913, '<td valign="top">till?<br/> <br/>nice shot over all, great focus also. i think the lighing is nice here but could''ve been improved bye the use of another light from the bottom of the fram to help calm the shadow of the hands</td>', 'till? nice shot over all, great focus also. i think the lighing is nice here but could''ve been improved bye the use of another light from the bottom of the fram to help calm the shadow of the hands', '2006-03-23 02:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2250150, 308315, 55710, '<td valign="top">beautiful.</td>', 'beautiful.', '2006-03-23 02:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2250154, 308703, 23913, '<td valign="top">really one of the best that i''ve seen, if it doesn''t place highly i can only think it must be the fact it doesn''t screem crative use of a 2 second exposure but nicly done with this, it is a splended B&amp;W has a great feel and great DoF.<br/> <br/>best of luck to you in this challenge<br/> <br/>10 fav.</td>', 'really one of the best that i''ve seen, if it doesn''t place highly i can only think it must be the fact it doesn''t screem crative use of a 2 second exposure but nicly done with this, it is a splended B&W has a great feel and great DoF. best of luck to you in this challenge 10 fav.', '2006-03-23 02:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2250155, 307463, 23913, '<td valign="top">lots of sensor dust in this, and its not basic you should''ve cleared the image of that. IMO</td>', 'lots of sensor dust in this, and its not basic you should''ve cleared the image of that. IMO', '2006-03-23 02:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2250159, 308507, 23913, '<td valign="top">a tad more contrast for shadow dencity would''ve been a great touch to this image.</td>', 'a tad more contrast for shadow dencity would''ve been a great touch to this image.', '2006-03-23 02:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2250160, 307103, 23913, '<td valign="top">nice image the sky bugs my tho b/c of all the color noise. neat image may help out in curing this in the futrue.</td>', 'nice image the sky bugs my tho b/c of all the color noise. neat image may help out in curing this in the futrue.', '2006-03-23 02:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2250166, 308709, 23913, '<td valign="top">this is cool and kind of modern art "ish"<br/> <br/>i like the nature of it and the fact that the ppl. hugging arn''t so blured that you can''t make out there actions. bold image GL</td>', 'this is cool and kind of modern art "ish" i like the nature of it and the fact that the ppl. hugging arn''t so blured that you can''t make out there actions. bold image GL', '2006-03-23 02:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2250168, 307719, 23913, '<td valign="top">this is way to low res. even for the web it displays all chunky and pixelated.</td>', 'this is way to low res. even for the web it displays all chunky and pixelated.', '2006-03-23 02:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2250169, 308721, 23913, '<td valign="top">great abstract/surreal/multi. exposure.....this is really a quite gripping image. holds the viewers intrust for somtime and makes the eye move through the image stopping here and there at choice places. well done</td>', 'great abstract/surreal/multi. exposure.....this is really a quite gripping image. holds the viewers intrust for somtime and makes the eye move through the image stopping here and there at choice places. well done', '2006-03-23 02:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2250174, 308357, 23913, '<td valign="top">simple. graphic. fav.</td>', 'simple. graphic. fav.', '2006-03-23 02:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2250178, 307939, 23913, '<td valign="top">the colors would be steller with a slight increase in saturation. and a little more contrast via curves to keep the lighting matching and even.</td>', 'the colors would be steller with a slight increase in saturation. and a little more contrast via curves to keep the lighting matching and even.', '2006-03-23 02:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2250180, 306313, 23913, '<td valign="top">this is very pretty, great color, could stand to have a USM for a littly more sharpness and clarity. at least for this version (the web image at a smaller size). GL</td>', 'this is very pretty, great color, could stand to have a USM for a littly more sharpness and clarity. at least for this version (the web image at a smaller size). GL', '2006-03-23 02:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
