(2250190, 308279, 39243, '<td valign="top">I like this shot - I wonder what the rest of DPC will think of your processing? 7</td>', 'I like this shot - I wonder what the rest of DPC will think of your processing? 7', '2006-03-23 02:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
