(2260302, 307079, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice.  Really like the lush green growth captured and how it contrasts well with the ''white'' water, which the 2 sec exposure has worked well here, as well as the black rocks.  The only two things I could try to suggest, and both are very minor, are a little more ''interest'', or detail at the bottom/fore (but difficult with the long exposure plus there are not too many rocks/stationary objects there) and the overall balance - just <i>seems</i> that this needs a whisker nudge rotation up on the right (but I realize this may well be dead level/straight so apologies in advance) - just a visual thing, and yes, just my opinion.  Perhaps a more refined crop also, especially on the sides, not sure.</td>', '8 - Very nice.  Really like the lush green growth captured and how it contrasts well with the ''white'' water, which the 2 sec exposure has worked well here, as well as the black rocks.  The only two things I could try to suggest, and both are very minor, are a little more ''interest'', or detail at the bottom/fore (but difficult with the long exposure plus there are not too many rocks/stationary objects there) and the overall balance - just seems that this needs a whisker nudge rotation up on the right (but I realize this may well be dead level/straight so apologies in advance) - just a visual thing, and yes, just my opinion.  Perhaps a more refined crop also, especially on the sides, not sure.', '2006-03-26 16:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2260308, 308738, 40370, '<td valign="top">Fun neon color, nicely centered, wonder what would look like without the entrance doors cut in half.</td>', 'Fun neon color, nicely centered, wonder what would look like without the entrance doors cut in half.', '2006-03-26 16:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2260309, 308025, 40370, '<td valign="top">Less of the "kinda cool" back wall and more of the lava next time.</td>', 'Less of the "kinda cool" back wall and more of the lava next time.', '2006-03-26 16:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2260315, 308324, 40370, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, could you bump up the contrast without altering the pic to much, seems washed out in a grayish tone ?? Make the sky and/or water more black.</td>', 'Nice composition, could you bump up the contrast without altering the pic to much, seems washed out in a grayish tone ?? Make the sky and/or water more black.', '2006-03-26 16:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2260320, 307267, 40370, '<td valign="top">Splendid, love the texture of the water in the distance and the calm in the foreground, birds are a perfect touch.</td>', 'Splendid, love the texture of the water in the distance and the calm in the foreground, birds are a perfect touch.', '2006-03-26 16:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2260322, 308038, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice scene and colors.  Good interesting elements with the boats with barrels(?) (don''t know the correct term for the boat, sorry).  The lighting is nice, as are the lines.  This just seems it needs a slight nudge rotation up on the left to get it more balanced/level, but might just be the perspective it was taken at, so apologies in advance if wrong.  Difficult, but perhaps a slight variation in the cropping, mainly bottom left, else the inclusion of the end of the boat(s) (if you had it obviously - although not sure on that as does work well as is) and ''somehow'' capturing more of that clouded/dusky water surface, may have made this even better in my opinion.</td>', '8 - Nice scene and colors.  Good interesting elements with the boats with barrels(?) (don''t know the correct term for the boat, sorry).  The lighting is nice, as are the lines.  This just seems it needs a slight nudge rotation up on the left to get it more balanced/level, but might just be the perspective it was taken at, so apologies in advance if wrong.  Difficult, but perhaps a slight variation in the cropping, mainly bottom left, else the inclusion of the end of the boat(s) (if you had it obviously - although not sure on that as does work well as is) and ''somehow'' capturing more of that clouded/dusky water surface, may have made this even better in my opinion.', '2006-03-26 16:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2260323, 307267, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice.  Good rich coloring that complements and ''lifts'' the darkness.  Just looks like it needs a little more balance somewhere, maybe the horizon more centered and more sky (if you had it obviously), else maybe more water, not sure.  A fraction more definition in the birds too, but likely difficult, retaining the detail in the sky as you have.</td>', '8 - Very nice.  Good rich coloring that complements and ''lifts'' the darkness.  Just looks like it needs a little more balance somewhere, maybe the horizon more centered and more sky (if you had it obviously), else maybe more water, not sure.  A fraction more definition in the birds too, but likely difficult, retaining the detail in the sky as you have.', '2006-03-26 16:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2260324, 308089, 40370, '<td valign="top">What a great place to shoot !! Like that the face is missing and that the hand on the banister isn''t moving, very cool. Top Ten !!</td>', 'What a great place to shoot !! Like that the face is missing and that the hand on the banister isn''t moving, very cool. Top Ten !!', '2006-03-26 16:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2260331, 306189, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice use of the exposure effect - just wish it were bigger, ''somewhere'', but realize this size likely doesn''t do it justice.  Doesn''t quite look balanced in my opinion.  Maybe more height frame-wise, not sure.  The color, blue especially, is very nice.</td>', '7 - Nice use of the exposure effect - just wish it were bigger, ''somewhere'', but realize this size likely doesn''t do it justice.  Doesn''t quite look balanced in my opinion.  Maybe more height frame-wise, not sure.  The color, blue especially, is very nice.', '2006-03-26 16:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2260334, 308836, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Don''t mind the grain/toning/pp effect(s) - gives it character.  A more finely tuned crop, especially on the left (elbow not cropped, or else more so), make this even better in my opinion.  Guessing the 2 sec picked up a street or porch/front light, which again adds to the feel and character here, so well ''used''.  Maybe a <i>fraction</i> dark, not sure.  A little less grain/etc (softer) in the face, likely also have helped this in my opinion.</td>', '7 - Don''t mind the grain/toning/pp effect(s) - gives it character.  A more finely tuned crop, especially on the left (elbow not cropped, or else more so), make this even better in my opinion.  Guessing the 2 sec picked up a street or porch/front light, which again adds to the feel and character here, so well ''used''.  Maybe a fraction dark, not sure.  A little less grain/etc (softer) in the face, likely also have helped this in my opinion.', '2006-03-26 16:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2260336, 308873, 40370, '<td valign="top">The gauzy wrapping has very nice texture and tone but the skull face is a little to blurry to match the scene, you probably have a reason for DOF here.<br/>I still like it and good luck.</td>', 'The gauzy wrapping has very nice texture and tone but the skull face is a little to blurry to match the scene, you probably have a reason for DOF here.I still like it and good luck.', '2006-03-26 16:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
