(2260450, 307820, 40370, '<td valign="top">The vertical composition works wonderfully in this image, the chosen tones are fasinating as well, one of my top ten.</td>', 'The vertical composition works wonderfully in this image, the chosen tones are fasinating as well, one of my top ten.', '2006-03-26 17:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2260451, 307650, 40370, '<td valign="top">So simple, yet simply wonderful to look at. You can feel it melting.</td>', 'So simple, yet simply wonderful to look at. You can feel it melting.', '2006-03-26 17:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2260458, 307726, 40370, '<td valign="top">Marvelous ... almost looks like a sanctuary in a high quality video game, I mean that as a compliment ... I think. Wonderful perspective, just not sure about the unreal feeling.</td>', 'Marvelous ... almost looks like a sanctuary in a high quality video game, I mean that as a compliment ... I think. Wonderful perspective, just not sure about the unreal feeling.', '2006-03-26 17:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2260466, 307740, 40370, '<td valign="top">Beautiful liquid image, the red wine color is superb (in a natural way) but the choice of the neon green background is terrible, it doesn''t compliment the dark burgundy color. Still a 6 for me.</td>', 'Beautiful liquid image, the red wine color is superb (in a natural way) but the choice of the neon green background is terrible, it doesn''t compliment the dark burgundy color. Still a 6 for me.', '2006-03-26 17:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2260470, 308795, 40370, '<td valign="top">I like the shift in color from deep red to light orange.</td>', 'I like the shift in color from deep red to light orange.', '2006-03-26 17:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2260473, 307606, 40370, '<td valign="top">This is a cool image to stare at for a while, BTW that''s a good thing.</td>', 'This is a cool image to stare at for a while, BTW that''s a good thing.', '2006-03-26 17:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2260478, 307619, 40370, '<td valign="top">The face is a bit to bright but the effect you created with the hands is very neat.</td>', 'The face is a bit to bright but the effect you created with the hands is very neat.', '2006-03-26 17:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2260485, 308338, 40370, '<td valign="top">Great eye makeup, I wonder what it would''ve looked like if the lollipop was moving away from (or to) her mouth rather than side to side.</td>', 'Great eye makeup, I wonder what it would''ve looked like if the lollipop was moving away from (or to) her mouth rather than side to side.', '2006-03-26 18:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2260491, 307080, 40370, '<td valign="top">I like this, I am a fan of high contrast (just not my own hehe). The little ripples of the water caught my eye.</td>', 'I like this, I am a fan of high contrast (just not my own hehe). The little ripples of the water caught my eye.', '2006-03-26 18:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2260493, 306189, 40370, '<td valign="top">The title sounds like a book a was supposed to read in high school ... ahhh. But seriously, lovely image, very natural looking colors.</td>', 'The title sounds like a book a was supposed to read in high school ... ahhh. But seriously, lovely image, very natural looking colors.', '2006-03-26 18:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2260495, 308087, 55959, '<td valign="top">Of the blurry clocks presented here, I think that this one is the best one... Good job :)</td>', 'Of the blurry clocks presented here, I think that this one is the best one... Good job :)', '2006-03-26 18:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2260499, 307871, 40370, '<td valign="top">Most excellent. How come there is no reflection anywhere on the 8 ball? Cloned out? If so you should''ve cloned the hot spot down on the right corner. Still top ten on my list.</td>', 'Most excellent. How come there is no reflection anywhere on the 8 ball? Cloned out? If so you should''ve cloned the hot spot down on the right corner. Still top ten on my list.', '2006-03-26 18:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2260500, 307198, 40370, '<td valign="top">Brilliant !!</td>', 'Brilliant !!', '2006-03-26 18:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2260504, 308616, 40370, '<td valign="top">Remarkable rule of thirds here, after I took the extra time to examine the foreground, I''ve decided I quite like this image, good luck.</td>', 'Remarkable rule of thirds here, after I took the extra time to examine the foreground, I''ve decided I quite like this image, good luck.', '2006-03-26 18:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2260505, 308245, 40370, '<td valign="top">Stunning focus throughout this image, the blue / green shades are beautiful. Can''t help but miss what more of the background trees would''ve look like.</td>', 'Stunning focus throughout this image, the blue / green shades are beautiful. Can''t help but miss what more of the background trees would''ve look like.', '2006-03-26 18:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2260506, 308316, 40370, '<td valign="top">Wow, so much action yet the main subjects are fairly focused, very cool event to photograph. I''d have tried to clone out the little fuzzy thing hanging down top left.</td>', 'Wow, so much action yet the main subjects are fairly focused, very cool event to photograph. I''d have tried to clone out the little fuzzy thing hanging down top left.', '2006-03-26 18:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2260520, 308705, 40370, '<td valign="top">Love the mud cracks, wish we could see a little more heighth in the very ominous clouds, bumping up.</td>', 'Love the mud cracks, wish we could see a little more heighth in the very ominous clouds, bumping up.', '2006-03-26 18:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
