(2261885, 308357, 50674, '<td valign="top">Great to get all these comments and, something to learn from each one. I had never taken a 2 sec shot before, and of course I got it wrong - thought 2 was two seconds. Now I know it is 2´´. And then I could have moved a few stops instead. Thank you all - and even 1 fave :-)<br/>I checked in forum, and saw that I would not get DQ''ed and entered because I really wanted to see how it would do. But I do try to meet the challenge every time.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-03-27 00:49:54.</i></td>', 'Great to get all these comments and, something to learn from each one. I had never taken a 2 sec shot before, and of course I got it wrong - thought 2 was two seconds. Now I know it is 2´´. And then I could have moved a few stops instead. Thank you all - and even 1 fave :-)I checked in forum, and saw that I would not get DQ''ed and entered because I really wanted to see how it would do. But I do try to meet the challenge every time.', '2006-03-27 01:28:55.000000', '2006-03-27 01:49:54.000000', 0),
