(2262735, 307079, 34938, '<td valign="top">Justin, there''s no doubt that this is a great shot from a great perspective. Congratulations.<br/> <br/>I need to say a few things about this shot:<br/>I''m really disappointed that you entered the 2 second challenge with a 1/2 second shot. It puts all of the hard work that several hundred photographers below you down the tubes. I didn''t enter the challenge, so it''s no sour grapes on my part. You got the ribbon, but you got it like an athlete who takes forbidden substances to get the edge over others. I know that''s harsh, but it''s the way I see it.<br/> <br/>I don''t expect you to give your ribbon back, but for a promising photographer with a superb portfolio, it''s something you need to learn from for the future. Fairness should be the first value of any challenge.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Justin, there''s no doubt that this is a great shot from a great perspective. Congratulations. I need to say a few things about this shot:I''m really disappointed that you entered the 2 second challenge with a 1/2 second shot. It puts all of the hard work that several hundred photographers below you down the tubes. I didn''t enter the challenge, so it''s no sour grapes on my part. You got the ribbon, but you got it like an athlete who takes forbidden substances to get the edge over others. I know that''s harsh, but it''s the way I see it. I don''t expect you to give your ribbon back, but for a promising photographer with a superb portfolio, it''s something you need to learn from for the future. Fairness should be the first value of any challenge. ', '2006-03-27 06:43:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(2262767, 307944, 54392, '<td valign="top">I was one out of 6 who voted a 9 for this image, I really love the shot and was expecting it to be higher up the ranks. Ah well, for me it was one of the best shots in this challenge.</td>', 'I was one out of 6 who voted a 9 for this image, I really love the shot and was expecting it to be higher up the ranks. Ah well, for me it was one of the best shots in this challenge.', '2006-03-27 07:01:50.000000', NULL, 0),
