(2262865, 307019, 47117, '<td valign="top">I really liked this one. I knew from my own experience it had to be over 2 seconds though, and I am very disappointed to see it wasn''t done in spirit of the challenge.</td>', 'I really liked this one. I knew from my own experience it had to be over 2 seconds though, and I am very disappointed to see it wasn''t done in spirit of the challenge.', '2006-03-27 07:51:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(2262872, 307079, 47117, '<td valign="top">My sentiments are definately with hotpasta''s comments.  I really don''t think this should have won and there should have been a special rule on this challenge to DQ any photo not within the 2 seconds. The whole idea was not to take any long exposure shot, but one within the rules which as you must be aware of, is not that easy with 2 seconds. <br/> <br/>It''s lovely and a wonderful photo, but it should have never been entered in a 2 second challenge when so many, including myself, went out of our way to stay within the spirit of the challenge.  Your ribbon was ill received. I appreciate your apology, but its a little too little and a little too late. :)</td>', 'My sentiments are definately with hotpasta''s comments.  I really don''t think this should have won and there should have been a special rule on this challenge to DQ any photo not within the 2 seconds. The whole idea was not to take any long exposure shot, but one within the rules which as you must be aware of, is not that easy with 2 seconds.  It''s lovely and a wonderful photo, but it should have never been entered in a 2 second challenge when so many, including myself, went out of our way to stay within the spirit of the challenge.  Your ribbon was ill received. I appreciate your apology, but its a little too little and a little too late. :)', '2006-03-27 07:55:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(2262877, 307726, 29156, '<td valign="top">this is absolutely great, tell us more about the processing, please</td>', 'this is absolutely great, tell us more about the processing, please', '2006-03-27 07:58:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2262890, 308245, 47117, '<td valign="top">Now THIS is a lovely shot. And NO PUG! I am very happy to see that, and your placement is very well received. I love this shot. Nicely done!!!<br/> <br/>I also agree with fotomann. If a waterfall shot was to win the blue, it should have been one entered using 2 seconds and in the true spirit of the challenge.  Kudo''s to you on this Shutterpug! :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-03-27 07:05:39.</i></td>', 'Now THIS is a lovely shot. And NO PUG! I am very happy to see that, and your placement is very well received. I love this shot. Nicely done!!! I also agree with fotomann. If a waterfall shot was to win the blue, it should have been one entered using 2 seconds and in the true spirit of the challenge.  Kudo''s to you on this Shutterpug! :)', '2006-03-27 08:03:38.000000', '2006-03-27 08:05:39.000000', 0),
