(2262903, 308680, 47117, '<td valign="top">You know, I can see how with the rainbow it was hard to pass up entering this photo, but it did not stay within the spirit of the challenge.<br/> <br/>I gave out many 7 votes to some of the top placements who really didn''t deserve them based on them not being entered with spirit of the challenge in mind. This took away from the shots that did, including my own. I am very disappointed in how so many on this site decided to just enter what they did when not adhereing to the 2 seconds.   It''s really a shame.</td>', 'You know, I can see how with the rainbow it was hard to pass up entering this photo, but it did not stay within the spirit of the challenge. I gave out many 7 votes to some of the top placements who really didn''t deserve them based on them not being entered with spirit of the challenge in mind. This took away from the shots that did, including my own. I am very disappointed in how so many on this site decided to just enter what they did when not adhereing to the 2 seconds.   It''s really a shame.', '2006-03-27 08:09:14.000000', NULL, 0),
