(2263329, 308752, 16241, '<td valign="top">those are the new kitty slippers you were telling me about?<br/>haha, well call it still life what u expect dumbo.  :))) - note 3 smileys<br/></td>', 'those are the new kitty slippers you were telling me about?haha, well call it still life what u expect dumbo.  :))) - note 3 smileys', '2006-03-27 11:27:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(2263357, 307079, 48339, '<td valign="top">it seems that the darkness of the photos indicates a two-second exposure could have been achieved in the right lighting.  later or earlier in the day would have allowed for this.  too bad you didn''t think that was important or you wouldn''t have submitted this 1/2 second shot taken with too much available light.</td>', 'it seems that the darkness of the photos indicates a two-second exposure could have been achieved in the right lighting.  later or earlier in the day would have allowed for this.  too bad you didn''t think that was important or you wouldn''t have submitted this 1/2 second shot taken with too much available light.', '2006-03-27 11:40:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2263368, 308752, 14476, '<td valign="top">Downright purrrrfect.  Great and rare image.</td>', 'Downright purrrrfect.  Great and rare image.', '2006-03-27 11:46:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(2263381, 307079, 52992, '<td valign="top">I voted you an -8-<br/> <br/>Wish I could take it back now though.</td>', 'I voted you an -8- Wish I could take it back now though.', '2006-03-27 11:48:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(2263406, 307198, 48339, '<td valign="top">great shot, but you should check your level again. it does appear that when the horizon is measured, the left side is slightly lower then the right horizon line.  i can see it without measuring.  you wanted balance right?</td>', 'great shot, but you should check your level again. it does appear that when the horizon is measured, the left side is slightly lower then the right horizon line.  i can see it without measuring.  you wanted balance right?', '2006-03-27 11:55:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(2263469, 307726, 24951, '<td valign="top">Yes please, please share! Sorry this came out twice. Congrats on your 4th. Really thought this would get a ribbon.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-03-27 11:22:36.</i></td>', 'Yes please, please share! Sorry this came out twice. Congrats on your 4th. Really thought this would get a ribbon.', '2006-03-27 12:20:15.000000', '2006-03-27 12:22:36.000000', 0),
(2263477, 307726, 5728, '<td valign="top">4th place :) Another green ribbon. But looking at the quality of the first 3 photos in this challenge I am honored to get 4th place gladly. Thank you for all the comments during the challenge. It was an interesting challenge to observe, especially the score which dipped below 7.000 about 7 or 8 times during the whole week :)<br/> <br/>About the post processing which many have asked about, it is just something I experimenting at in 16 bit mode which I still have to refine. I will write more about it once I got my hooks into it properly!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-03-27 12:34:23.</i></td>', '4th place :) Another green ribbon. But looking at the quality of the first 3 photos in this challenge I am honored to get 4th place gladly. Thank you for all the comments during the challenge. It was an interesting challenge to observe, especially the score which dipped below 7.000 about 7 or 8 times during the whole week :) About the post processing which many have asked about, it is just something I experimenting at in 16 bit mode which I still have to refine. I will write more about it once I got my hooks into it properly!', '2006-03-27 12:23:04.000000', '2006-03-27 13:34:23.000000', 0),
(2263541, 307196, 37779, '<td valign="top">ALRIGHT DOODE!!! Congrats on your ribbon (you beat me to it, punk!)!!! ROCK ON!</td>', 'ALRIGHT DOODE!!! Congrats on your ribbon (you beat me to it, punk!)!!! ROCK ON!', '2006-03-27 12:48:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(2263547, 307196, 20462, '<td valign="top">i echo sonifo on this one</td>', 'i echo sonifo on this one', '2006-03-27 12:50:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(2263585, 308077, 22099, '<td valign="top">I like the concept. It is somewhat over exposed and it is difficult to tell that the light is the moon. I agree that it should be considered a still but it does not seem to be in the astrophotography category.</td>', 'I like the concept. It is somewhat over exposed and it is difficult to tell that the light is the moon. I agree that it should be considered a still but it does not seem to be in the astrophotography category.', '2006-03-27 13:00:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(2263594, 308245, 37252, '<td valign="top">Thank you everyone for the nice comments. The "see and no Pug" comments really are kind out there as if you look through my portfolio - MOST my shots do not contain pugs. So please, give me a break on the pug comments and leave them just on the merits of this shot itself. Sorry if I sound sour on that, just felt the need to say it.<br/> <br/>doctornick - I only wish this had ribboned. I myself do not understand why the words "exactly 2 seconds" were put in the challenge details if they were not going to be upheld. So be it. I had fun shooting this and it''s my highest score to date. :-)</td>', 'Thank you everyone for the nice comments. The "see and no Pug" comments really are kind out there as if you look through my portfolio - MOST my shots do not contain pugs. So please, give me a break on the pug comments and leave them just on the merits of this shot itself. Sorry if I sound sour on that, just felt the need to say it. doctornick - I only wish this had ribboned. I myself do not understand why the words "exactly 2 seconds" were put in the challenge details if they were not going to be upheld. So be it. I had fun shooting this and it''s my highest score to date. :-)', '2006-03-27 13:03:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2263601, 308245, 5792, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on breaking the "7" barrier and finishing 5th. Higher scores are getting more difficult to achieve. Yours is one of my personal top three for this challenge. It is a great image in every way.</td>', 'Congratulations on breaking the "7" barrier and finishing 5th. Higher scores are getting more difficult to achieve. Yours is one of my personal top three for this challenge. It is a great image in every way.', '2006-03-27 13:07:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(2263605, 308254, 42567, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Congratulations on your top 20!</td>', 'Very nice!  Congratulations on your top 20!', '2006-03-27 13:09:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(2263612, 306259, 42567, '<td valign="top">This is such a great picture!  I thought it would finish in the top 10...Still a great finish!</td>', 'This is such a great picture!  I thought it would finish in the top 10...Still a great finish!', '2006-03-27 13:11:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(2263613, 307196, 9913, '<td valign="top">dude you ribboned:D<br/>Congrats ;)</td>', 'dude you ribboned:DCongrats ;)', '2006-03-27 13:12:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(2263626, 307079, 37252, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo. A real shame though that you can deny the honest entries a ribbon with the "imitation 2 second shot".<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-03-27 13:16:27.</i></td>', 'Beautiful photo. A real shame though that you can deny the honest entries a ribbon with the "imitation 2 second shot".', '2006-03-27 13:19:40.000000', '2006-03-27 14:16:27.000000', 0),
