(2263675, 307726, 3032, '<td valign="top">Would never have guessed this was yours. :)<br/>Cool processing, I bet this looks even better printed on specific papers/canvas.<br/></td>', 'Would never have guessed this was yours. :)Cool processing, I bet this looks even better printed on specific papers/canvas.', '2006-03-27 13:42:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(2263684, 308279, 41746, '<td valign="top">I like this alot. Provokes brainstorm in my head! Creative and inspiring as always, Aznym.</td>', 'I like this alot. Provokes brainstorm in my head! Creative and inspiring as always, Aznym.', '2006-03-27 13:48:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(2263689, 307856, 50231, '<td valign="top">Thank you very much for another lesson. I have learned so much for you.</td>', 'Thank you very much for another lesson. I have learned so much for you.', '2006-03-27 13:52:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(2263699, 307522, 38706, '<td valign="top">Great idea to mix the stillness and movement.  Congrats on the high place.</td>', 'Great idea to mix the stillness and movement.  Congrats on the high place.', '2006-03-27 13:58:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(2263739, 307196, 45764, '<td valign="top">Great job... if people did not think it met the challenge they should have voted it lower.  If you don''t want to post it took you 7 minutes to get the shot you don''t have to.  Or you can if you want... they can''t take your ribbon away from you.  Once again great job and I like how you gave credit to this being a tribute!</td>', 'Great job... if people did not think it met the challenge they should have voted it lower.  If you don''t want to post it took you 7 minutes to get the shot you don''t have to.  Or you can if you want... they can''t take your ribbon away from you.  Once again great job and I like how you gave credit to this being a tribute!', '2006-03-27 14:16:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2263766, 307196, 39057, '<td valign="top">GREAT SHOT...however, I do agree with the rest. If this is not a 2 second exposure then it should not have been entered. I scored entries by KNOWING how hard a 2 sec shot is to master. I don''t think it is fair to the others that used a 2 second exposure.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by youngnova:</b></div><hr/><i> Great job... if people did not think it met the challenge they should have voted it lower.  If you don''t want to post it took you 7 minutes to get the shot you don''t have to.  Or you can if you want... they can''t take your ribbon away from you.  Once again great job and I like how you gave credit to this being a tribute! </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'GREAT SHOT...however, I do agree with the rest. If this is not a 2 second exposure then it should not have been entered. I scored entries by KNOWING how hard a 2 sec shot is to master. I don''t think it is fair to the others that used a 2 second exposure. Originally posted by youngnova: Great job... if people did not think it met the challenge they should have voted it lower.  If you don''t want to post it took you 7 minutes to get the shot you don''t have to.  Or you can if you want... they can''t take your ribbon away from you.  Once again great job and I like how you gave credit to this being a tribute! ', '2006-03-27 14:30:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2263795, 308245, 50231, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot! In my book it has a ribbon! Nice job slaughtering the fotomann!</td>', 'Fantastic shot! In my book it has a ribbon! Nice job slaughtering the fotomann!', '2006-03-27 14:39:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(2263880, 307079, 9111, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the blue ribbon... It was well won...</td>', 'Congratulations on the blue ribbon... It was well won...', '2006-03-27 14:59:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(2263886, 307079, 11518, '<td valign="top">No rules were broken and the photo looks like it could have been a 2 sec exposure. Period.  Let''s move on.</td>', 'No rules were broken and the photo looks like it could have been a 2 sec exposure. Period.  Let''s move on.', '2006-03-27 15:00:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(2263913, 307196, 11518, '<td valign="top">No rules were broken and the photo looks like it could have been a 2 sec exposure. Period. Let''s move on.</td>', 'No rules were broken and the photo looks like it could have been a 2 sec exposure. Period. Let''s move on.', '2006-03-27 15:06:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(2263995, 307079, 49948, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by doctornick:</b></div><hr/><i> No rules were broken and the photo looks like it could have been a 2 sec exposure. Period.  Let''s move on. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>agreed<br/>jsut pretend the water was moving in slow motion<br/>ta da....i think?<br/>great shot!</td>', 'Originally posted by doctornick: No rules were broken and the photo looks like it could have been a 2 sec exposure. Period.  Let''s move on.   agreedjsut pretend the water was moving in slow motionta da....i think?great shot!', '2006-03-27 15:25:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(2264013, 307267, 41337, '<td valign="top">Did you steal Rikki''s camera? lol. Seriously, great shot.</td>', 'Did you steal Rikki''s camera? lol. Seriously, great shot.', '2006-03-27 15:31:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(2264086, 307079, 42020, '<td valign="top"><b>Details:</b> Take a photograph using a shutter speed of exactly 2 seconds.<br/> <br/>Uhh.. ok. great shot. Not 2 seconds, but great shot. Maybe you submitted to the wrong challenge?</td>', 'Details: Take a photograph using a shutter speed of exactly 2 seconds. Uhh.. ok. great shot. Not 2 seconds, but great shot. Maybe you submitted to the wrong challenge?', '2006-03-27 16:03:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(2264148, 307079, 37719, '<td valign="top">Really a shame this won the ribbon...nice shot yes, but not a 2 second shot and no attempt was made to do it in 2 sec.  A real slap in the face to all of those who made the honest effort to get the shot they wanted in 2 sec.</td>', 'Really a shame this won the ribbon...nice shot yes, but not a 2 second shot and no attempt was made to do it in 2 sec.  A real slap in the face to all of those who made the honest effort to get the shot they wanted in 2 sec.', '2006-03-27 16:39:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(2264154, 307196, 37719, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but clearly doesn''t look like a 2 second shot.  And funny that you didn''t post your shutter speed.  If it isn''t a 2 second exposure, should not have ribboned and is a real slap in the face to those that made the honest effort to get a 2 second exposure.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-03-27 15:43:08.</i></td>', 'Nice shot but clearly doesn''t look like a 2 second shot.  And funny that you didn''t post your shutter speed.  If it isn''t a 2 second exposure, should not have ribboned and is a real slap in the face to those that made the honest effort to get a 2 second exposure.', '2006-03-27 16:40:52.000000', '2006-03-27 16:43:08.000000', 0),
(2264158, 307619, 55480, '<td valign="top">It definitely did not do as well as it should have. Sorry, I would have given it higher if I could have voted.</td>', 'It definitely did not do as well as it should have. Sorry, I would have given it higher if I could have voted.', '2006-03-27 16:41:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(2264246, 307196, 25355, '<td valign="top">There''s a festival in Kumamoto, Japan, where you can do the same thing with bundles of straw - but the rope is shorter than what yours appears to be. (And it gets really warm...)</td>', 'There''s a festival in Kumamoto, Japan, where you can do the same thing with bundles of straw - but the rope is shorter than what yours appears to be. (And it gets really warm...)', '2006-03-27 17:19:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(2264269, 307198, 30861, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by deepfrog17:</b></div><hr/><i> great shot, but you should check your level again. it does appear that when the horizon is measured, the left side is slightly lower then the right horizon line.  i can see it without measuring.  you wanted balance right? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It''s illusionary: on the right side the water is separating more strongly from the sky than it is on the left. The horizon is precisely level. I''ve checked it.</td>', 'Originally posted by deepfrog17: great shot, but you should check your level again. it does appear that when the horizon is measured, the left side is slightly lower then the right horizon line.  i can see it without measuring.  you wanted balance right?   It''s illusionary: on the right side the water is separating more strongly from the sky than it is on the left. The horizon is precisely level. I''ve checked it.', '2006-03-27 17:29:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(2264277, 308877, 24454, '<td valign="top">I think this is a BEAUTIFUL photo!  I am really surprised to see a 5.9 score.   It was one of my favorites in the challenge!  Great job!!!</td>', 'I think this is a BEAUTIFUL photo!  I am really surprised to see a 5.9 score.   It was one of my favorites in the challenge!  Great job!!!', '2006-03-27 17:34:08.000000', NULL, 0),
