(2264490, 308836, 37961, '<td valign="top">I just realized that I hadn''t commented on this photo yet. I guess it just slipped right by me. Anyway I hope your not too mad at me for it. :)<br/> <br/>I really think this is one of your best entries to date. Everything about it is balanced and pleasant. I love that your feet are crossed too. The light is soft and shadowy. Congrats on one of your personal bests.</td>', 'I just realized that I hadn''t commented on this photo yet. I guess it just slipped right by me. Anyway I hope your not too mad at me for it. :) I really think this is one of your best entries to date. Everything about it is balanced and pleasant. I love that your feet are crossed too. The light is soft and shadowy. Congrats on one of your personal bests.', '2006-03-27 18:55:55.000000', NULL, 0),
