(2265680, 307079, 16493, '<td valign="top">Awsome photo and probably deserves a ribbon in some other challenge.<br/> <br/>Well,if you think about it like this:<br/>the winner in high jump is the  "pole vaulter" jumping over 5m high.<br/> <br/>But it''s not your fault, there should have been added an extra rule to the challenge that said it must be a 2sek exposure.<br/> <br/>If it where my picture I would ask for a DQ my self since I would not feel good having earnd  a blue ribbon this way.</td>', 'Awsome photo and probably deserves a ribbon in some other challenge. Well,if you think about it like this:the winner in high jump is the  "pole vaulter" jumping over 5m high. But it''s not your fault, there should have been added an extra rule to the challenge that said it must be a 2sek exposure. If it where my picture I would ask for a DQ my self since I would not feel good having earnd  a blue ribbon this way.', '2006-03-28 05:22:07.000000', NULL, 0),
