(2271728, 308823, 17148, '<td valign="top">:: Critique Club ::<br/> <br/>I think this is exposed very well...good use of the flash to burn in the subject and not have a blurry mess. I like the blue outlines...almost looks like his spirit or aura. Very interesting shot. The mike stand coming from the bottom left is just a tad distracting...but you might not have been able to help that due to where you were sitting or something else. I like the expression that you got from him. Overall I like the image and way to make it work for the challenge.<br/> <br/></td>', ':: Critique Club :: I think this is exposed very well...good use of the flash to burn in the subject and not have a blurry mess. I like the blue outlines...almost looks like his spirit or aura. Very interesting shot. The mike stand coming from the bottom left is just a tad distracting...but you might not have been able to help that due to where you were sitting or something else. I like the expression that you got from him. Overall I like the image and way to make it work for the challenge. ', '2006-03-29 21:39:56.000000', NULL, 0),
