(2403772, 308245, 58615, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the recognition for this well deserving photo. When I saw the challenge results I thought it should have ribboned especially with the whole "2 second scam".</td>', 'Congrats on the recognition for this well deserving photo. When I saw the challenge results I thought it should have ribboned especially with the whole "2 second scam".', '2006-05-10 21:35:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(2408829, 308222, 18207, '<td valign="top">In general, I don''t like waterfall scenes with long exposures but here you found a good balance between smooth effect of flow and hard effect of still water surface. Looking at the water only I feel that it''s somewhat cold out there and this feeling is reflected on other parts of the photo (the icycles, the leaves, the moss, the colors, the light). Makes me want to see it in a larger size. Great one!</td>', 'In general, I don''t like waterfall scenes with long exposures but here you found a good balance between smooth effect of flow and hard effect of still water surface. Looking at the water only I feel that it''s somewhat cold out there and this feeling is reflected on other parts of the photo (the icycles, the leaves, the moss, the colors, the light). Makes me want to see it in a larger size. Great one!', '2006-05-12 07:30:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2419636, 308245, 38267, '<td valign="top">Really cool shot here.  The fact that you kept the small pond in the frame makes all the difference.  I like the color a lot where the water starts to make its way from the pond to those first three falls.  Lovely work and deserving of the great score.</td>', 'Really cool shot here.  The fact that you kept the small pond in the frame makes all the difference.  I like the color a lot where the water starts to make its way from the pond to those first three falls.  Lovely work and deserving of the great score.', '2006-05-16 03:11:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(2425753, 308836, 50674, '<td valign="top">There is something so appealing about doorways, about windows too. This one is both secretive and promising at the same time. I like.</td>', 'There is something so appealing about doorways, about windows too. This one is both secretive and promising at the same time. I like.', '2006-05-17 14:54:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(2431922, 308836, 26756, '<td valign="top">Great shot with beautiful tones.  Really like your pose here.</td>', 'Great shot with beautiful tones.  Really like your pose here.', '2006-05-18 22:28:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(2477321, 306592, 14837, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot.  I would actually bump up the contrast a bit more so that it is more of a Silhouette.  Congrats to you for being able to sit on a ball for 2 seconds!  I would''ve been on the floor before I even got on the ball!  haha</td>', 'This is a nice shot.  I would actually bump up the contrast a bit more so that it is more of a Silhouette.  Congrats to you for being able to sit on a ball for 2 seconds!  I would''ve been on the floor before I even got on the ball!  haha', '2006-06-01 22:39:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(2481867, 308038, 57886, '<td valign="top">What a great picture. It is well done in every way.. The boats do a lot for the picture to, they like "frame" it...  Nice colors, crisp and clear... and congrats on your high score :o)</td>', 'What a great picture. It is well done in every way.. The boats do a lot for the picture to, they like "frame" it...  Nice colors, crisp and clear... and congrats on your high score :o)', '2006-06-03 18:45:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(2511238, 308188, 34396, '<td valign="top">Very slick image.  This looks like something straight out of a glossy car ad.  Love the crisp colors and reflections.  Keep up the great work!</td>', 'Very slick image.  This looks like something straight out of a glossy car ad.  Love the crisp colors and reflections.  Keep up the great work!', '2006-06-13 01:07:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(2513694, 308245, 59343, '<td valign="top">I love this picture.  I love the still and clear reflection of the pool in the background and the motion captured in the foreground.  Beautiful photograph--I''ve tried to do photos like this, but not with such success.</td>', 'I love this picture.  I love the still and clear reflection of the pool in the background and the motion captured in the foreground.  Beautiful photograph--I''ve tried to do photos like this, but not with such success.', '2006-06-13 19:13:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2523204, 307334, 59343, '<td valign="top">I love this image.  I love the soft water and incredible detail in the moss and rocks.  Great job.  I can''t really find much to comment on to make this better.</td>', 'I love this image.  I love the soft water and incredible detail in the moss and rocks.  Great job.  I can''t really find much to comment on to make this better.', '2006-06-16 20:01:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(2531942, 307606, 48739, '<td valign="top">Dont know if i commented on this before but i did give you a 9.... WOW this caught my eye i like this alot!! just amazing love it!!</td>', 'Dont know if i commented on this before but i did give you a 9.... WOW this caught my eye i like this alot!! just amazing love it!!', '2006-06-20 13:41:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2542241, 307334, 58197, '<td valign="top">Love it:)</td>', 'Love it:)', '2006-06-22 19:26:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(2547006, 307148, 16912, '<td valign="top">Coming from my <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=336521&amp;page=1" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">1-4-0</a>  thread ...<br/> <br/>Hi Bill, the thumbnail of this shot is almost like a cityscape but for me the larger image doesn''t do the thumb justice.<br/> <br/>I think you got the lighting spot on (its not easy) but the focus is a little off. For me the blue bottle is the winner in this comp and thus should be more prominent in the shot. Leaving the comp as you have it I think if the lighter bottle and candle were more central in the ''space'' you may have scored better. I''ll not mention its not quite straight (doh!)</td>', 'Coming from my 1-4-0  thread ... Hi Bill, the thumbnail of this shot is almost like a cityscape but for me the larger image doesn''t do the thumb justice. I think you got the lighting spot on (its not easy) but the focus is a little off. For me the blue bottle is the winner in this comp and thus should be more prominent in the shot. Leaving the comp as you have it I think if the lighter bottle and candle were more central in the ''space'' you may have scored better. I''ll not mention its not quite straight (doh!)', '2006-06-23 22:34:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(2627973, 307019, 14986, '<td valign="top">This is so stunning.  I feel like I''m standing in the field looking at the sky.  :)   I like that it appears you didn''t mess with it a lot in editing...it looks very natural.</td>', 'This is so stunning.  I feel like I''m standing in the field looking at the sky.  :)   I like that it appears you didn''t mess with it a lot in editing...it looks very natural.', '2006-07-16 23:08:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(2644167, 308836, 39664, '<td valign="top">Judy!  This is awesome!  You are so good with those filters.  I would love to learn how you picked all this up!<br/> <br/>Forever your Georgia Fan.......Cheryl</td>', 'Judy!  This is awesome!  You are so good with those filters.  I would love to learn how you picked all this up! Forever your Georgia Fan.......Cheryl', '2006-07-20 21:19:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2760921, 308509, 9668, '<td valign="top">This is really cool! Love the colors and the abstraction of it. Beautiful.</td>', 'This is really cool! Love the colors and the abstraction of it. Beautiful.', '2006-08-25 22:28:46.000000', NULL, 0),
