(2946764, 308836, 30982, '<td valign="top">What with all your high scores of late, this one is going to slip into the abyss.  Too bad - I really like this one!</td>', 'What with all your high scores of late, this one is going to slip into the abyss.  Too bad - I really like this one!', '2006-10-20 11:00:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(2972459, 307196, 67324, '<td valign="top">This is rad Caleb, The fz20 is not bad at night shots, even with the limited shutter length. The FZ20 is limited to 8 seconds max from what I can remember,but i believe it would of been 2 seconds, he would have caused more blur longer and also the streaks from the embers would have dropped more looking ugly like badly timed fireworks pictures. I love the tendrils the sparks make. I would have given it 7+ had i been a member then.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-10-29 08:07:20.</i></td>', 'This is rad Caleb, The fz20 is not bad at night shots, even with the limited shutter length. The FZ20 is limited to 8 seconds max from what I can remember,but i believe it would of been 2 seconds, he would have caused more blur longer and also the streaks from the embers would have dropped more looking ugly like badly timed fireworks pictures. I love the tendrils the sparks make. I would have given it 7+ had i been a member then.', '2006-10-29 08:00:02.000000', '2006-10-29 08:07:20.000000', 0),
(3096998, 307267, 69387, '<td valign="top">This shot is incredibly beautiful!</td>', 'This shot is incredibly beautiful!', '2006-12-07 15:15:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(3150534, 308038, 63131, '<td valign="top">This is such a cool shot!</td>', 'This is such a cool shot!', '2006-12-26 19:42:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(3150961, 308038, 69008, '<td valign="top">This image must really be exquisite in full resolution. It''s beautiful even at this resolution.  The light at the right edge is just a bit bright, maybe just to me, but otherwise it''s outstanding.</td>', 'This image must really be exquisite in full resolution. It''s beautiful even at this resolution.  The light at the right edge is just a bit bright, maybe just to me, but otherwise it''s outstanding.', '2006-12-26 23:07:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(3165582, 308245, 67145, '<td valign="top">amazing and beautiful image ...<br/>the water, the ice, the colours, the composition ... just beautiful ...<br/>i especially like that gorgeous yellow/brown bit where the water starts to drop over the falls ...</td>', 'amazing and beautiful image ...the water, the ice, the colours, the composition ... just beautiful ...i especially like that gorgeous yellow/brown bit where the water starts to drop over the falls ...', '2006-12-31 23:23:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3321956, 308752, 6349, '<td valign="top">Ha!  My 2 second exposures of my cat look nothing like this.  Not even my 1 second exposure.  The slight softness from motion in the face is just enough to convince me that you didn''t use a stuffed cat.  :)</td>', 'Ha!  My 2 second exposures of my cat look nothing like this.  Not even my 1 second exposure.  The slight softness from motion in the face is just enough to convince me that you didn''t use a stuffed cat.  :)', '2007-02-03 08:09:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(3327007, 307267, 73499, '<td valign="top">Kickass.</td>', 'Kickass.', '2007-02-04 18:30:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(3352989, 308852, 23484, '<td valign="top">I generally don''t like shots where there is a lot of distortion from a wide angle lens but this shot is different.  I think the angle that you took it from turns that distortion into an asset.<br/> <br/>The lighting and color are supurb. It''s amazing that you were able to get that kind of lighting from the inside of the building.  I guess you got it at the right time.<br/> <br/>I didn''t vote in this challenge but this shot would have been an 8-9 from me.</td>', 'I generally don''t like shots where there is a lot of distortion from a wide angle lens but this shot is different.  I think the angle that you took it from turns that distortion into an asset. The lighting and color are supurb. It''s amazing that you were able to get that kind of lighting from the inside of the building.  I guess you got it at the right time. I didn''t vote in this challenge but this shot would have been an 8-9 from me.', '2007-02-11 12:54:44.000000', NULL, 0),
